[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2994432398","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107853#issuecomment-2994432398","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107853","id":2994432398,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ye2mO","user":{"login":"precup","id":709680,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwOTY4MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/709680?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup","html_url":"https://github.com/precup","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-22T20:29:04Z","updated_at":"2025-06-22T20:29:04Z","body":"I can confirm this is happening. Closing and reopening the scene in question seems to release the memory, there doesn't seem to be a permanent leak, but the memory use does seem to increase without bound while using the bucket tool. I went from < 1 GB of memory used to 3+ GB by doing spam clicking the bucket tool for a little while.\n\n> Godot v4.4.1.stable (49a5bc7b6) - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 3 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2080 Ti (NVIDIA; 31.0.15.3713) - AMD Ryzen 9 3900X 12-Core Processor (24 threads)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2994432398/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2996744200","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107853#issuecomment-2996744200","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107853","id":2996744200,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ynrAI","user":{"login":"chocola-mint","id":56677134,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2Njc3MTM0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56677134?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint","html_url":"https://github.com/chocola-mint","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-23T14:34:38Z","updated_at":"2025-06-23T14:34:38Z","body":"I've been looking into this, and I've found something quite worrying about the TileMapLayerEditor in general.\n\nWith the same MRP, pick the bucket tool, select a tile to draw, and just keep moving your cursor across the grid. The memory leak happens even *without* actually performing the operation.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/919470bc-48ff-459d-826e-d7c428971881\n\nAnd it works with the brush tool as well!\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c35feb03-7b5c-4321-b752-2aa1e5ab4b32)\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/78bd1f5f-f9f1-44cd-b8ea-2fe63433a597)\n\nPerhaps there might be a memory leak with `draw_string`?\n\n(For other contributors interested in investigating, Visual Studio's heap profiler can be useful here)\n\n(Branch is 4.5-beta)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2996744200/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2996966407","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107853#issuecomment-2996966407","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107853","id":2996966407,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yohQH","user":{"login":"chocola-mint","id":56677134,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2Njc3MTM0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56677134?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint","html_url":"https://github.com/chocola-mint","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-23T15:38:16Z","updated_at":"2025-06-23T15:38:16Z","body":"A quick test reveals that the actual \"memory leak\" here is just, lots and lots of redundant do/undo methods being recorded by the bucket tool.\n\nThe culprit here is `TileMapLayerEditorTilesPlugin::_draw_bucket_fill`, which inserts tiles to the output even if the tile isn't actually changed, and a tentative fix was able to successfully address the memory leak.\n\nThe same issue may technically affect other tools though, so I'll work on a more thorough fix.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2996966407/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":3,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2999449362","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107853#issuecomment-2999449362","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107853","id":2999449362,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yx_cS","user":{"login":"groud","id":6093119,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwOTMxMTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6093119?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud","html_url":"https://github.com/groud","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-24T09:02:58Z","updated_at":"2025-06-24T09:02:58Z","body":"> A quick test reveals that the actual \"memory leak\" here is just, lots and lots of redundant do/undo methods being recorded by the bucket tool.\n\nOh I was wondering. Had a quick look at the code and couldn't find what could cause that. The fix is likely a bit easy here (checking if values are different before adding them to the list). \n\nBut the bad news is that, if that's the main issue, I don't think we'll be able to optimize undo-redo here much, aside from getting rid of the oldest changes in the UndoRedo stack.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2999449362/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]